0013: the hostile reflex's shield preparation (equip a carried shield while hostiles are near) waits for a short
foreground action of the player's (craft, smelt, equip, eat, place, drop, a container, a pickup) to finish instead of
taking the body over in the middle of it. A production game (2026-10-11) crafted a shield at night with two hostiles
near: the reflex preempted the craft right after the shield appeared, before its temporary crafting table was picked
up again, and the craft was reported failed. Responses to real threats are unchanged. With a test (hostile).

diff --git a/src/survival/reflexes/hostile.test.ts b/src/survival/reflexes/hostile.test.ts
